# {{.Name}}

{{.Description}}

Scaffolded by `docket plugin new`. Develop it against a running Docket with:

```sh
docket plugin dev .      # link, enable here, validate on save, stream reloads{{if .Service}} and service logs{{end}}
```

Files:

- `docket-plugin.yaml`: the manifest (`docket docs plugins`).
{{- if .Widget}}
- `ui/widget.html`: opened when the `{{.Name}}/status` widget is expanded in a task's activity.
- `bin/{{.Name}}`: `docket {{.Name}} TASK-ID` publishes a widget record on a task.
{{- end}}
{{- if .Panel}}
- `ui/panel.html`: a tab in task detail.
{{- end}}
{{- if .Page}}
- `ui/page.html`: a workspace page at `/workspaces/<ws>/p/{{.Name}}/overview`.
{{- end}}
{{- if .Service}}
- `server/index.mjs`: the supervised service, reached from frames via `docket.json(path)`.
{{- end}}
- `ui/style.css`: shared styles using Docket's theme tokens.

Edits under `ui/` reload open frames in place{{if .Service}}; edits under `server/` restart the service{{end}}.
Guides: `docket docs plugins/authoring` and `docket docs plugins/ui`.
